 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> 쓰레기를 보물로 바꾸는 대장간에 오신 걸 환영합니다. 잡동사니를 이리저리 짜 맞춰 아주 색다른 무기 수천 가지를 만들고, 가게를 업그레이드하고, 새로운 제작법으로 무기고를 넓히세요. 개성 넘치는 드래곤, 할머니, 펭귄, 로봇 등등의 별난 손님들을 만족시키세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/d27a7af97f287078648a8942dfdf3b4e.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=337 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >쓰레기 더미를 박박 뒤져 다음 무기로 변신시킬 만한 완벽한 재료를 찾아내세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e43d5db66b5e72875a3f7df8e73384d0.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Craft Wacky Weapons\" width=418 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >찾아낸 재료를 모아 가장 창의적인 무기를 만들어보세요. 조랑말 망치도 좋고, 쿠키 방패도 멋지겠네요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"rhythm minigames being played\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/ce020c40edbdae103b406d7d3cdd55cc.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Serve unconventional customers\" width=450 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >강아지, 미라, 괴물들까지! 희한한 손님들에게 제작품을 판매하세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Short clips of different customers\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/cc617851976502f3e2ac97e1312c1d9d.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/4338e17876d4ba651d7d430ad892e23d.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Upgrade your store\" width=404 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >라쿤 디오게네스에게서 여러 종류의 장식품을 구매해 대장간을 업그레이드하세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"The black hole upgrade is bought and then used to clean trash\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/6af827e5adca8246f223e563abfe84e2.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >특징</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >쓰레기 더미에서 찾아내는 제작 재료</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >재료를 합쳐 만드는 우스꽝스러운 무기</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >완벽한 제작품을 위한 미니게임</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >이상하고 인상깊은 손님들과의 거래</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >대장간 업그레이드 및 쓰레기 기반 사업의 자동화</p></li></ul>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> 쓰레기를 보물로 바꾸는 대장간에 오신 걸 환영합니다. 잡동사니를 이리저리 짜 맞춰 아주 색다른 무기 수천 가지를 만들고, 가게를 업그레이드하고, 새로운 제작법으로 무기고를 넓히세요. 개성 넘치는 드래곤, 할머니, 펭귄, 로봇 등등의 별난 손님들을 만족시키세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/d27a7af97f287078648a8942dfdf3b4e.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Scavenge the trash\" width=337 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >쓰레기 더미를 박박 뒤져 다음 무기로 변신시킬 만한 완벽한 재료를 찾아내세요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" aria-label=\"Trash being collected from a trash can\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.webm?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/972f78a9f31c1799cbfd8d983304195a.mp4?t=1789877581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/e43d5db66b5e72875a3f7df8e73384d0.webp?t=1789877581\" alt=\"Craft Wacky Weapons\" width=418 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >찾아낸 재료를 모아 가장 창의적인 무기를 만들어보세요. 조랑말 망치도 좋고, 쿠키 방패도 멋지겠네요.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4359360/extras/55dc5dd85e889d02c0984c01ba63cb45.poster.avif?t=1789877581\" 